{"id":"4922f5599894afb1","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-cat-pullback.md","title":"ZFC Cat Pullback","display":"df-zfc-cat-pullback — ZFC Cat Pullback","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-pullback","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-pullback"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-pullback — ZFC Cat Pullback","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-pullback"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-pullback</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-pullback — ZFC Cat Pullback"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,A,B,C,P,f,g,p_A,p_B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,A,B,C,P,f,g,p_A,p_B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C),s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C),s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>（六元组范畴码的规范投影）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>（范畴结构谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S(P,p_A,p_B,A,B,C,f,g,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A,B,C,P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f,g,p_A,p_B\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=C\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(g)=B\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(g)=C\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(p_A)=P\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(p_A)=A\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(p_B)=P\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(p_B)=B\\\\\n&amp;\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad s_{\\mathcal C}(a)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(a)=A\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(b)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(b)=B\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}a=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}b\n\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\ns_{\\mathcal C}(u)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(u)=P\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{50mm}\\land p_A\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=a\n\\land p_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=b\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S(P,p_A,p_B,A,B,C,f,g,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A,B,C,P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f,g,p_A,p_B\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=C\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(g)=B\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(g)=C\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(p_A)=P\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(p_A)=A\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(p_B)=P\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(p_B)=B\\\\\n&amp;\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad s_{\\mathcal C}(a)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(a)=A\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(b)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(b)=B\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}a=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}b\n\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\ns_{\\mathcal C}(u)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(u)=P\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{50mm}\\land p_A\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=a\n\\land p_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=b\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every arrow is guarded by the source and target projections of the same category code, and all compositions use its specified composition operation.</li>\n<li>The final bounded unique quantifier is exactly the universal mediating-arrow clause.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)$（范畴结构谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,A,B,C,P,f,g,p_A,p_B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C),s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S(P,p_A,p_B,A,B,C,f,g,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A,B,C,P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land f,g,p_A,p_B\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=C\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(g)=B\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(g)=C\\\\\n&\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(p_A)=P\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(p_A)=A\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(p_B)=P\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(p_B)=B\\\\\n&\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_B\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\quad s_{\\mathcal C}(a)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(a)=A\n\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(b)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(b)=B\\\\\n&\\quad\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}a=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}b\n\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(\ns_{\\mathcal C}(u)=X\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(u)=P\\\\\n&\\hspace{50mm}\\land p_A\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=a\n\\land p_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=b\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2061,"backlinks":[{"id":"78c3be29a4eab0f7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1568","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-cat-pullback.md|58-df-zfc-cat-pullback]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8790486ac053461c","e637becf421e4e61"]}